OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786724321
OL,3,CFour killed in Japan after record-
OL,4,Cbreaking rainfall floods homes and
OL,5,Croads
OL,7,FAt least four people have died and one
OL,8,Fperson is missing after record-
OL,9,Fbreaking rainfall in the east of Tokyo
OL,10,Fflooded roads and dozens of homes.
OL,12,FThe floods have also caused power
OL,13,Foutages across the region, stranding
OL,14,Fthousands of people and causing
OL,15,Fhundreds to take shelter overnight at
OL,16,Fthe Chiba prefectural government
OL,17,Fbuilding.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
