FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31003
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786724321
OL,3,CFour killed in Japan after record-
OL,4,Cbreaking rainfall floods homes and
OL,5,Croads
OL,7,FPhotos and television footage showed
OL,8,Fwidespread damage after daylight, with
OL,9,Fhomes, cars and parts of railway
OL,10,Ftracks flooded with muddy water.
OL,12,FThe torrential rain and flooding also
OL,13,Fknocked out power to about 23,000
OL,14,Fhomes on Friday morning, down from
OL,15,F68,000 earlier, according to the TEPCO
OL,16,FPower Grid.
OL,18,FRecord-breaking rainfall of 11.5 cm
OL,19,Ffell in just one hour in Chiba City
OL,20,Fand a further record-breaking 9.7 cm
OL,21,Fin one hour in Sakura.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
