FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786724321
OL,3,CFour killed in Japan after record-
OL,4,Cbreaking rainfall floods homes and
OL,5,Croads
OL,7,FThe Japan Meteorological Agency
OL,8,Fdowngraded its most severe warning for
OL,9,Fheavy rain in more than a dozen
OL,10,Fmunicipalities in the Chiba Prefecture
OL,11,Fas rain subsided on Friday morning,
OL,12,Fbut more is forecast for later in the
OL,13,Fday.
OL,15,FThe Ground Self-Defence Force said it
OL,16,Fdispatched buses to pick up about
OL,17,F4,000 stranded people who stayed
OL,18,Fovernight at the Soga train station, a
OL,19,Flocal route that also serves Tokyo
OL,20,FDisney. The theme park did not report
OL,21,Fany damage.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
