OL,3,CFour killed in Japan after record-
OL,4,Cbreaking rainfall floods homes and
OL,5,Croads
OL,7,FThousands more people were stuck
OL,8,Fovernight at the Narita airport
OL,9,Fserving the Tokyo region, with trains
OL,10,Fout of the area stopped.
OL,12,FServices partially resumed on Friday
OL,13,Fmorning with delays, while flights in
OL,14,Fand out of Narita were operating
OL,15,Fnormally, with many people returning
OL,16,Fhome at the end of Japan's Bon
OL,17,FBuddhist holiday week.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
